    "description": "This is our app-new event app. It will be used for showing the agenda, speakers, and other practical information about the event. In the app you will be able to answer polling questions as well as asking questions to the stage. The app will be used to send out push notifications with updates before and during the event. We hope you will enjoy using these and many more features in the app during the event.",
